# Rewritten by every training run -- never a result anyone chose to
# keep, and tracking them meant a run dirtied the repo and a stray
# `git add -A` could commit scratch over a real one. Saved policies get
# a durable name instead (sac_policy_room_best.npz, or _s<SEED> from
# reproduce_room.sh).
